  "description": "Open a password-encrypted Excel workbook and save one encrypted, as Excel's Encrypt with Password does; managed .NET, no Office, no interop, no need for the DocWright Word package. XlsxEncryption opens an encrypted .xlsx as an ordinary XlsxDocument (DocWright.Spreadsheet) for editing, calculation and rendering, and saves with ECMA-376 agile encryption (AES-256, SHA-512, 100,000 spins); agile and standard encryption are read, and the key derivation is bounded against hostile files.",
